cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite the paper below."
title: "Ground-Truth Evaluation of Graph Neural Network Explainers for Network Routing"
abstract: >-
  A routing task over real network topologies with planted, per-sample-verified
  bottleneck links and off-route decoys, used to evaluate eleven GNN explainers
  against a known reference explanation rather than against fidelity.
type: software
authors:
